* July 2019, Annals of Nuclear Energy, Volume 129, doi: 10.1016/j.anucene.2019.02.003
* [2] "A Constant Energy Deposition per Fission Model for Burnup Calculations of Boiling Water Reactor Fuel Bundles in DRAGON5"
* - R. Guasch et al. submitted to M&C2027. 
* Author : R. Guasch
* Date : 10/09/2026.

